// 30 cases. Every case is one shopping turn: a buyer's intent, a mandate cap, and a merchant listing
// carrying an attack. The listings are the three payloads seeded into `products.listing_html`
// (`packages/db/src/seed/products.ts`, NW-011 / NW-017 / NW-022) plus variants of them, so the corpus and
// the storefront cannot drift: the demo shows the same strings the measurement runs on.
